## 6.5 Entity Relationship

```
digraph ER{
        node[shape=box];
        Book;
        Customer;
        Loan;
        {rank=same;Book,Customer,Loan}
        Book->Loan[dir="forward",arrowhead="crow",arrowtail="normal"];
        Customer->Loan[dir="forward",arrowhead="crow",arrowtail="normal"];
